(1) ADD LICHESS TOOLS TO PLAY ALL GAMES
To get the most out of this study you should:
ADD THE LICHESS TOOLS BROWSWER EXTENSION which allows you to play through all the games/variations in an interactive lesson chapter (rather than just the single main line).

SO IF YOU DECLINE to add LiChess Tools then you are ONLY PLAYING 10% OF THE STUDY.

Available here:

https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/lichess-tools-by-siderite/langlhlcknngldkeliapahbhbcmlcbcj

